{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/local-government-reorganisation-review-update-letters-to-council-leaders","content_id":"2d4c8dae-f904-4f01-b20b-5b49dfc9b238","description":"Letters to council leaders in 9 areas with decisions being withdrawn on 29 October, and a letter to 6 areas where decisions were withdrawn in September and areas where decisions have not yet been taken.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6ae36c6ed22fc5fecb3eb7f9","filename":"Local_government_reorganisation_-_withdrawn_letter_to_9_areas.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":184915,"filename":"Local_government_reorganisation_-_withdrawn_letter_to_9_areas.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9584394","isbn":"","number_of_pages":3,"title":"Local government reorganisation: withdrawn letter to 9 areas","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6ae36c6ed22fc5fecb3eb7f9/Local_government_reorganisation_-_withdrawn_letter_to_9_areas.pdf"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6ae366b6d22fc5fecb3eb7ee","filename":"Local_government_reorganisation_-_review_letter_to_6_areas.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":186884,"filename":"Local_government_reorganisation_-_review_letter_to_6_areas.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9584320","isbn":"","number_of_pages":3,"title":"Local government reorganisation: review letter to 6 areas","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6ae366b6d22fc5fecb3eb7ee/Local_government_reorganisation_-_review_letter_to_6_areas.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>On 29 October 2026, the Minister for Local Government, Devolution and Regional Growth wrote to council leaders in the 15 remaining areas awaiting minded-to decisions as part of the local government reorganisation review.</p>\n\n<p>The letters cover:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>9 areas where decisions announced in July 2026 have now been withdrawn</li>\n  <li>4 areas where decisions were withdrawn in September 2026 and Cambridgeshire and Peterborough and West Sussex, where decisions have not yet been taken</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>No new minded-to decisions have been announced for these 15 areas. The letters provide an update on the next phase of the review.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-10-29T16:39:54Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","emphasised_organisations":["1390d07f-12b3-4f55-9dd5-fec5fd9e3649"],"featured_attachments":["9584394","9584320"],"first_public_at":"2026-10-29T16:39:54.000+00:00","national_applicability":{"england":{"applicable":true,"label":"England"},"northern_ireland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Northern Ireland"},"scotland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Scotland"},"wales":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Wales"}},"political":true,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"correspondence","first_published_at":"2026-10-29T16:39:54+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/local-government-reorganisation-review-update-letters-to-council-leaders","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/local-government-reorganisation-review-update-letters-to-council-leaders","base_path":"/government/publications/local-government-reorganisation-review-update-letters-to-council-leaders","content_id":"2d4c8dae-f904-4f01-b20b-5b49dfc9b238","document_type":"correspondence","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-10-29T16:39:54Z","schema_name":"publicati